      ],
      "source": "https://www.mathiston.ms.gov/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Mathiston sits along the historic Old Natchez Trace, just a mile north of a trading post once owned by Choctaw Chief David Folsom.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
